  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has initiated a series of meetings with leaders of political parties within his coalition to address the vacancy in the vice presidency. Following an initial gathering at the Bogor Palace, the president is coordinating with coalition members to reach a consensus on a successor for the outgoing vice president, Gibran. Various political entities, including the Golkar and PKS parties, have confirmed that they are awaiting further instructions from the president regarding this transition. While coalition members have offered input on preferred characteristics for the new vice president, they have publicly committed to deferring the ultimate choice to the president. The process is nearing a final stage as these discussions move toward the official submission of a candidate to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR).",
